@startuml sm_defence_system
title State Machine Diagram 1: Defence System States

skinparam backgroundColor #F0F4F8
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EAF4FB
  BorderColor #2471A3
  BorderThickness 2
  FontColor #1A2F45
  ArrowColor #1A5276
  ArrowThickness 2
  StartColor #1B3A5C
  EndColor #B71C1C
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #F9A825
}

' Declare colors for non-composite states
state Monitoring #D5E8D4
state TargetConfirmed #FFF9C4
state AlarmGenerated #FFE082
state InRange #FF8A65

[*] --> Monitoring : system start

Monitoring : entry / startSensorLoop()
Monitoring : do / pollSensors() every 100ms
Monitoring --> ActivityDetected : sensor detects activity
Monitoring --> Monitoring : no activity

state ActivityDetected #D5E8D4 {
  [*] --> PreProcessing
  PreProcessing : do / filterNoise()
  PreProcessing --> Fusing : edge processor complete
  Fusing : do / kalmanFilter() + mergeDetections()
  Fusing --> Identifying : fusion complete
  Identifying : do / runMLInference()
  Identifying --> [*]
}

ActivityDetected --> TargetConfirmed : AI target identified\n(confidence > 0.85)
ActivityDetected --> Monitoring : no target found

TargetConfirmed : entry / classifyThreatLevel()
TargetConfirmed : do / initTracking()
TargetConfirmed --> AlarmGenerated : alarm created\noperator notified

AlarmGenerated : entry / notifyOperator(alarm)
AlarmGenerated : do / awaitOperatorDecision()
AlarmGenerated --> DefenceReady : operator approves
AlarmGenerated --> Monitoring : operator denies

state DefenceReady #FFCC80 {
  [*] --> WakeUp
  WakeUp : entry / setStatus(WAKEUP)
  WakeUp --> GetReady : select device
  GetReady : entry / selectBestDevice()
  GetReady : do / calculateRoute()
  GetReady --> Deploying : deploy to intercept
  Deploying : do / moveToIntercept()
  Deploying --> [*]
}

DefenceReady --> InRange : device reaches target range

InRange : entry / requestFinalConfirmation()
InRange : do / trackTargetRealTime()
InRange --> Engaged : operator confirms engagement
InRange --> DefenceReady : target position changed
InRange --> Monitoring : operator aborts

state Engaged #EF9A9A {
  [*] --> ActionExecuting
  ActionExecuting : do / executeDefenceAction()
  ActionExecuting --> EvaluatingResult : action complete
  EvaluatingResult : do / evaluateHitOrMiss()
  EvaluatingResult --> [*]
}

Engaged --> MissionAccomplished : HIT confirmed
Engaged --> Recalculating : MISS detected

state MissionAccomplished #A5D6A7 {
  [*] --> StandingDown
  StandingDown : do / recallDevice()
  StandingDown --> RecallDevice
  RecallDevice --> ArchiveData
  ArchiveData : do / archiveAllMissionData()
  ArchiveData --> [*]
}

MissionAccomplished --> Monitoring : cleanup complete

state Recalculating #CE93D8 {
  [*] --> UpdatingTrack
  UpdatingTrack : do / updateWithLatestSensorData()
  UpdatingTrack --> NewTrajectory : recalculate
  NewTrajectory : do / adjustKalmanParameters()
  NewTrajectory --> NewInterceptPoint : predict intercept
  NewInterceptPoint : do / recalculateInterceptPoint()
  NewInterceptPoint --> [*]
}

Recalculating --> AlarmGenerated : new action ready\noperator re-approval needed

note right of DefenceReady #FFCC80
  Defence transitions:
  WAKEUP > GET READY > DEPLOYING
  Device drives/flies to intercept
end note

note left of Recalculating #E1BEE7
  On MISS:
  - Update Kalman parameters
  - Recalculate trajectory
  - Propose new intercept point
  - Request operator re-approval
end note

note bottom of MissionAccomplished #C8E6C9
  HIT confirmed by sensors.
  Archive all mission data.
  Return to standby monitoring.
end note

@enduml
